    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etamayiana Isaak Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa peyie eaku Isaak moruo oleng metaa eiliilaitie inkonyek metaa meekure edolisho neipotu Esau olkikau lenye, nejoki ninye, “Enkerai ai” neng'amaa menye ajoki, “Nele nanu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ing'ura, atamorua nemayiolo enkolong naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudumu imasaa inono, emootian ino tenebo enkawuo ino, nilo ong'ota pee kilo ang'oroki eng'ues. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikintobiraki endaa namelok, anaa enoshi nanyor, nikiyaki mainosa peyie aatum atamayiana eton eitu aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa Rebeka, einining'ito Isaak olayioni lenye Esau. Metaa ore peyie edumunye Esau alo ong'ata ang'or eng'ues, nayau ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki Rebeka olayioni lenye Yakobo “Atoning'o papaai lino eirorie olalashe lino Esau ejoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Iyakaki eng'ues nikilotu aitobiraki endaa sidai. Natum ainosa naamayian iyie te dukuya Olaitoriani eton eitu aye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa tena kata olayioni lai, toning'o ororei lai anaa enaaitanap ajoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shomo intare, niking'uraki ilbalelon aare sidain, peyie aitobirie endaa namelok sidai naaijo enoshi nanyor papaai lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyaki ninye papaai lino meinosa peyie kitum atamayiana eton eitu eye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka Yakobo Rebeka ng'otonye, “Ng'ura ajo ore Esau olalashe lai naa oltung'ani oju, nara nanu oltung'ani osipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eidimayu naairrapirrap papa nanu, natiu nanu anaa oltung'ani olej ninye, nayaki kewan oldeket ajo emayianata aing'oru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ng'otonye ninye, “Inchoo oldeket lino elotu shumata nanu enkerai ai, toning'o ake iyie ororei lai nikilo aing'uraki ilbalelon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eshomo ayau ninche ayaki ng'otonye, neitobir ng'otonye endaa sidai namelok naaijo enoshi nanyor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishopoki Rebeka inkilani sidan e Esau olkikau lenye, naata tiaji, olayioni lenye oti Yakobo, neripaki indapan oo lbalelon inkaik enyena tenebo emurt enye nasipa. Neisho ninye endaa sidai namelok tenebo emukate naitobira olayioni lenye Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena dapan oo lbalelon nepik inkaik enyena o ine wueji nesipa te murt enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neisho ninye endaa sidai namelok tenebo emukate naitobiraka epik inkaik o layioni lenye Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eshomo ninye ajingaki menye nejoki, “Papa”. Neng'amaa ajoki, “Nele nanu, ira ng'ae enkerai ai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yakobo menye, “Nanu doi Esau olkikau lino. Aidipa ataasa anaa enikitiaka. Inyo totona inosa inkiri oo ng'uesi aainei peyie kitum atamayiana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka Isaak olayioni lenye, “Kaji doi inkuna peyie itasioko taata atum olayioni lai?” Newal ajoki, “Amu aaishoo Olaitoriani Enkai ina dupoto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee ejoki Isaak Yakobo, “Wou tinyiku, peyie atum airrapirrapa ajur enkerai ai, matayiolo katukul metii olng'ash ajo ira olayioni lai Esau anaa aimira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku neigutaki Yakobo Isaak papaai lenye. Neirrapirrap ninye nejo, “Ore oltoilo naa oltoilo le Yakobo, kake ore inkaik naa ine Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitu eyiolou ninye amu ore inkaik enyena naa keju anaa ino lalashe lenye Esau, neaku etamayiana ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Aira hoo doi olayioni lai Esau?” Newal ajo, “Ekara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejo, “Iyakaki nanu peyie atum ainosa inkiri oo ng'uesi o layioni lai naatum atamayiana.” Neaku eyaua ninye ayaki ninye, nenya ninye; neyaki ninye enaisho oo sabibu neok ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejoki Isaak olayioni lenye, “wou tinyikakaki tung'ututaki olayioni lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 11.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Metaa etinyikua ninye neng'utut ninye neing'uaya olng'usil too nkilani enyena, nemayian ninye ejo, “Ing'ura olng'usil lo layioni lai otiu anaa olng'usil liong'ata otamayiana Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikinchoo Enkai enkolielio e keper, tenebo empiron e nkop, tenebo enkisampuare sapuk o enaisho oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 12.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inchoo kisiaai iyie iloreren, nikigilaki kung iyie iloshon. Taa olkitok too lalashera linono, naa inchoo ilayiok le ng'utunyi kirrugokino iyie. Metedeki pooki ng'ae likidek, nemayiani pooki ng'ae likimayian iyie!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etoomonuo Esau emayianata e Isaak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake enaidipie Isaak atamayiana Yakobo, ore ake enaipangie Yakobo aing'uaa ine netii Isaak Papaai lenye, nejingu olalashe lenye Esau eing'uaa engorore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitobir sii ninye endaa sidai namelok, neyau ayaki papaai lenye. Nejoki menye “Inchoo papa lai edumunye aton ainos inkiri e ng'ues pee kitum atamayiana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neng'amaa papaai lenye Isaak ajoki ninye, “Ira doi ng'ae?” Newal ajoki, “Nanu doi olayioni lino, olkikau lino Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netum Isaak olokirikiri sapuk le ng'oro nejo ninye; “Aing'ae doi naaji otang'oro eng'ues naayaki nanu, nainosa pooki eton eitu ibau, naidipa atamayiana ninye? Nesipa Ee, naa kemayiana ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ening Esau irorei le papaai lenye neishir abuaku to ltoilo sapuk o te mion, nejoki papaai lenye, “Oi tamayianaki sii nanu, nchooki sii nanu emayianata ino, papaai lai!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka, “Eewuo olalashe lino to losek, neewa emayianata ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.29+GEN.25.30+GEN.25.31+GEN.25.32+GEN.25.33+GEN.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 25.29-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo Esau, “Aime keji doi te sipata etejoki enkarna enye Yakobo? Naaeseka ninye nanu kuna katitin are. Ewa apa ninye esipata ai e kikausho, naa ng'ura ake ajo enyaaka tena kata aya emayianata ai.” Ina peyie ejoki “Keitu hoo ninye kilekaki nanu emayianata?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Isaak Esau ejo, “Ing'ura ajo aitaa ninye olkitok lino, naa ore ilalashera lenyena, aishoo ninye meitaa isinkan, naa too lpaek tenebo enaisho oo sabibu aitotio ninye. Kaa naa taata aaitaas enkerai ai?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
