        {
          "text": " Nejoki Esau papaai lenye, “Ke mayianata nabo duoo ake iata papaai lai? Oi tamayianaki sii nanu, nchooki sii nanu emayianata ino, papaai lai!” Neilepie Esau oltoilo lenye neishir.",
