            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Newaliki Isaak papaai lenye ajoki, “ng'ura, iyaku ololamita empiron enkop te manyisho ino, niaku sii ololamita enkoliolio e keper e shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.39",
