              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina kata, neibayu Esau Yakobo enkaraki emayianata natamayiana papaai lenye ninye. Nejo Esau to ltau lenye. “Etabautua inkolong'i naishiraki papaai, ore peyie eishunye natum ataara metua olalashe lai Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore irorei le Esau ilo ayioni lenye botor etolikioki Rebeka; metaa eirriwayie Rebeka lkiliku meipoti ilo ayioni lenye oti, Yakobo nejoki ninye, “Ingura, ore olalashe lino Esau, eitagolito kewan oshoke pee kitum atara tua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa ore tena kata enkerai ai toning'o oltoilo lai tudumunye isikaki enetii Laban olalashe lai otii Haran, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niton tenebo ninye te nkiti rishata, ometaba anaa neyagaa engoro napi olalashe lino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o metaba anaa nerrinyo engoro olalashe lino. Nerikino enintaasa ninye, naa kairriu olkilikuai mikitorikuni te ine. Ainyoo peyie aiturraa intae pookira te keeya te nkolong nabo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
