              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejoki Rebeka Isaak, “Enaure enkishui ai tenkaraki kuna kituaak oo Lhiti. Teneyam sii ninye Yakobo nabo o nkituaak oo Lhiti naaijo kuna, nabo oo nkituaak ena kop, kainyoo tipat enkishui te nanu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
